      "text": "taking everything into account, I think we're dealing with a quinsy, a peritonsillar abscess at this stage i'm sending you for an urgent ENT drainage because of peritonsillar abscess what I'm giving you is benzylpenicillin, 1.2 grams, now, single dose that should help with peritonsillar abscess"
